{"id":"500337","name":"营养排骨汤","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"","cover":"images/500337/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"精排","amount":"1500克"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"山药","amount":"半根"},{"name":"鲜玉米棒","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"4片"},{"name":"葱段","amount":"3段"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨买来清洗干净，用两小时泡去血水（这样，可是排骨汤非常的鲜）。","img":"images/500337/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/500337/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鲜玉米切段，胡萝卜切滚刀块。","img":"images/500337/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"山药去皮，切片。","img":"images/500337/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"精排铺在砂锅底部。","img":"images/500337/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"铺上鲜玉米段。","img":"images/500337/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再铺上胡萝卜块。","img":"images/500337/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入葱段和姜片。","img":"images/500337/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"葱叶切成葱花。","img":"images/500337/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"砂锅内倒入开水，炖煮40分钟。","img":"images/500337/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖上盖子，砂锅煮沸之后转小火继续炖煮。","img":"images/500337/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"时间到了之后加入山药片。","img":"images/500337/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入食盐（此时加入，可使排骨汤很鲜美）。","img":"images/500337/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"关火前撒上葱花即可。","img":"images/500337/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}